currency CHF 0.01

account equity:starting
account assets:bank
  + tag undeclared
account assets:movables
  + tag undeclared
  + attach movables-balance.txt
account assets:machinery
  + tag undeclared
  + attach machinery-balance.txt
account expenses:cloud
account expenses:banking
account expenses:groceries
account expenses:charity
account expenses:rent:private
account expenses:VAT

tag deductible
tag not-deductible
tag tax-deductible
tag not-vat-deductible
tag undeclared
tag duplicate-attachment

2023-12-31
  | Opening balances
  * equity:starting -10000 CHF
  * assets:bank      10000 CHF
  * assets:movables      0 CHF
  * assets:machinery     0 CHF

2024-02-01
  | Cloud bill, a business expense on an account no category claims
  * assets:bank    -108.10 CHF
  * expenses:cloud  100.00 CHF
  * expenses:VAT      8.10 CHF ~e 8.1%
  + attach receipt.txt
  + tag deductible
  + tag duplicate-attachment

2024-02-02
  | Bank fee without VAT
  * assets:bank      -5 CHF
  * expenses:banking  5 CHF
  + attach receipt.txt
  + tag tax-deductible
  + tag not-vat-deductible
  + tag duplicate-attachment

2024-02-03
  | Groceries, which are private
  * assets:bank        -50 CHF
  * expenses:groceries  50 CHF
  + tag not-deductible

2024-02-04
  | Rent, on an account that the home office category claims
  * assets:bank           -2000 CHF
  * expenses:rent:private  2000 CHF
  + tag not-deductible

2024-02-05
  | Donation, a deduction of its own
  * assets:bank       -200 CHF
  * expenses:charity   200 CHF
  + attach receipt.txt
  + tag tax-deductible
  + tag not-vat-deductible
  + tag duplicate-attachment
